.rem Every feature of the language on one page. Panel 0: ink and
.rem placement. Panel 1: fills. Panel 2: the repertoire. Panel 3:
.rem links and the odd cases. The page starts in panel 0 without
.rem saying so. The title bar is an alias, used on every panel.
.def bar
.fg white
.bg blue
.fill
$bar
.enddef
.bar FEATURES · ΟΛΑ · 1/4
.at 2
.fg red
RED at column 0: the code is in
.fg green
GREEN the tail of the row, and
.fg yellow
YELLOW text keeps its column.
.fg blue
BLUE
.fg magenta
MAGENTA
.fg cyan
CYAN
.fg white
WHITE
.fg default
.at 10
plain then
.fg cyan
+ cyan then
.fg default
+ plain again.
.fg cyan
LABEL
.fg default
.col 8
value on the label's row
.at 12
 leading spaces position the run
   and paint nothing, so this
     staircase keeps its ground.
.at 16
.fg yellow
    Four spaces in: the code
.fg default
    takes the blank before the
text, and column 0 returns.
.at 20 10
.at 20 6
.at 20 2
One-shot .at: this run is at
column 2 and the next is back at
column 0.
.fg white
.bg blue
.fill 27
.at 27 2
INK · ΜΕΛΑΝΙ
.bar FEATURES · ΟΛΑ · 3/4
.at 2
rules    ─────── │ │ │
arrows   ← ↑ → ↓
blocks   ░ ▒ ▓ █
symbols  ° ± × ÷ • ·
ascii    A-Z a-z 0-9 !"#$%&'()*
         ,-./:;<=>?@\^_`{|}~
euro     € 12 · pound £ 9
box      ┌┬┐ ├┼┤ └┴┘ · àèéìòù ÀÈÉÌÒÙ
typo     ‘quote’ “quote” 1–2 — x
marks    ☺ ☹ ♥ ★ ✓ ✗
status   ● on  ○ off
.at 14
.fg cyan
Greek   αβγδεζηθικλμνξοπρςστυφχψω
.fg default
accents  άέήίόύώϊϋΐΰ
capitals ΑΒΓΔΕΖΗΘΙΚΛΜΝΞΟΠΡΣΤΥΦΧΨΩ
punct    «Καλώς ήρθατε» … ―
.at 20
Bars from blocks, one ink each:
.fg green
 ok    ████████████░░░░  75%
.fg yellow
 warn  ██████░░░░░░░░░░  38%
.fg red
 fail  ██░░░░░░░░░░░░░░  13%
.fg white
.bg blue
.fill 27
.at 27 2
CELLS · ΨΗΦΙΑ
